{"parse": {"title": "TTS-14", "pageid": 141720, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-13\" title=\"TTS-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-15\" title=\"TTS-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AD.98.E5.9C.A8.E4.B9.8B.E6.AC.B2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"存在之欲\">存在之欲</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 存在之欲</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Existence-Will</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>存<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>存<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>存<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810114</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>“‘时空灾害’发生后，受芝诺与基金会联合派遣，我继续率领部队于中亚追击重塑之手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>“然而，我方情报系统全线瘫痪，只能依靠侦察兵取得零星情报。截至目前，部队已于七日内遭受三场伏击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-649412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-649412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-649412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>“此次追击行动中，三名士兵不幸牺牲，另有十三人需要长期医疗援助……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>委员将报告翻过一页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-649412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-649412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-649412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>“行动的大部分时间里，我们无法判断敌人数量、位置，甚至无法确认是否仍在交战状态。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接下来的内容被大篇幅涂黑，难以诵读。伊里内伊的目光落回会议桌另一头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这是伊戈尔将军近日呈递的报告书，他是站在抗击重塑之手阴谋第一线的将领。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>如您所闻，肯纳女士。混乱、失序、无法判断敌我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这就是基金会面临的现状。您知道最可怕的一点是什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>从近期收到的各类报告来看，这已经成为了某种常态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我想我们都在学着适应，委员阁下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>也要学着取舍——很遗憾，你们的小小奇迹并未通过第一阶段的验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>一个无法落地的重建方案，我们没有理由再对它进行投入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>……我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>接下来，委员会将削减项目预算，并将其投入对重塑之手的防御与监控中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>奠基石是基金会唯一幸存的建筑师。很快，她和蓝图都将直接参与这些关键工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>肯纳轻叹一声，平静地收拾起桌上纷乱的报告——芝诺、拉普拉斯，甚至洛伦兹的来信……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我很遗憾。她们都竭尽了全力，离成功或许只有一步之遥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>不必气馁，肯纳女士。“新办事处建设”项目不会被废止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>未来，你们仍有机会重返诺瓦米奇。而现在，那栋建筑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>委员沉默片刻，目光落在桌上摊开的建筑草图上，眼神锐利如鹰隼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>为了防止它落入重塑之手的控制，我们将按照流程，对它实施全盘接管。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-3_8_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>全盘接管我理解，但……直接驱赶居民？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>恕我直言，伊里内伊先生。这和我们的修复实验相比，更像是另一种意义上的“冒进”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工独自躲在一处僻静的角落，压低的声音难掩此刻内心的波动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>我想我有必要提醒你——重塑之手在世界范围内掀起的波澜，也是相当“冒进”的自杀式袭击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>在当前局势下，谨慎并不代表安全，我只是在为最坏的局面作打算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>那我们要怎么安置这里的居民？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>基金会正与当地政府商议安置政策。详细的方案还在拟订中，但进展乐观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这些居民待在那里既不合法，又很危险。我们会尽可能保障他们的权益。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……我不知道该怎么和他们开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>昨天奥尔加奶奶笑着和我说，等穹顶修好了，会邀请我们一起在下面喝茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>我理解你的心情，蓝图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-649420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>但有些工作是我们必须做的。成熟一点，想想那些离开的同伴们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯被毫不留情切断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-649012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-649012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-649012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢齐安：</div><div>他们要赶走我们，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个声音在背后轻轻响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们不知何时都聚拢在她身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>我们都听见了——你和你那位冷酷无情的老板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我很抱歉，各位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢齐安：</div><div>所以……这里现在是，未来也永远只能是个破屋顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢齐安：</div><div>要是再来一次“时空灾害”，它什么用也顶不上。所有人都会消失，就像爸爸妈妈一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩闷声踢开脚边的一枚石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>*&amp;%**！（混蛋，岂有此理）！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>我才是这里真正的老大，为什么没有事先通报我？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刚刚“出狱”的老大愤怒地挥舞着圆润的双手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自上一版草图完结后，这还是它首次在众人面前现身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>那……这里的东西也会全部拆掉吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣有些茫然地望着眼前的电视机、碎花的墙纸和阳光洒落的中庭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我喜欢这里。我喜欢和卢齐安，和大家一起看电视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>《荒唐童话》才只看了一半呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她飞奔到电视机前，笨拙地环抱住憨态可掬的方形屏幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>不要拆可以吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>如果一定要拆的话……可不可以把电视机留给我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这当然不是她能决定的事。蓝图几乎是有些狼狈地将目光移开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>奠基石，这种时候不应该由你来——嗯？你这是在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师背朝众人站在墙角，仿佛面壁思过的罪人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我在想……这些角落里裸露的混凝土，和建筑内其他地方的完美主义风格似乎有所出入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这恐怕不是因甲方缺钱而被迫偷工减料的缘故。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>粗糙、原始、笃定——仿佛无比耐心地等待着被看见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在建筑内曾见过太多类似的细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">嘘……听到了吗，斯塔夏？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">……只有在安静的时候，那些我们平时看不见、听不着的东西才会出来。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">就好像……它们已经等了我们很久很久了。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……你们也在等我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她望着脚下的砖石，轻声说道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>好了，你们也别哭丧着脸。这不是你们的错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>我们早就习惯四处流浪了。从空无一人的故乡，到工厂宿舍、仓库，再到这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>每次刚开始感觉到“这里像家”——产生诸如此类的念头——就得收拾包袱狼狈离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>在这片土地上，我们学会的第一件事就是：没有什么是真正属于我们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他再次露出招牌的、讥讽而冷漠的微笑，然而嘴角刚扯起一半——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啪——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师一巴掌拍在了他的头上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你这副要死不活的模样，我早就看不顺眼了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>蓝图，伊里内伊先生的政府安置计划从确定到落地实施，有预估的时间吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……最多一个月。你想干什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工投来警惕的一瞥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不干什么。只是……我对安置工作完全是外行，只会帮倒忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这一个月的时间里，我想我应该拥有一定程度的自由——探亲访友、休养生息，或是继续画一些“不切实际”的设计图……应该是合规的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们沉默地看向她，眼神里有惊讶、怀疑，也有隐约的希冀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你还没有放弃……还是说，你已经有思路了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>有一些隐约的直觉，但不能保证成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>目光沿着回声石的残骸表面缓慢移动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我只需要确认一件事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师走过去，双手按在石面上——冰凉、坚硬、纹丝不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你要干嘛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石没有回答。她抄起一旁的施工锤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>等等——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一锤落下，石屑飞溅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>不……不要这样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>疯掉啦！我早就说过了，黑眼圈这么重，肯定不对劲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第二锤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群往后退了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手背伤口迸裂，血珠在空中划出几道凌乱的弧线，染红青灰色的砖石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>嘶……好痛。不过没关系，只剩最后一步……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声石顺着自身的裂隙断裂、解体，直到彻底化为一地碎屑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好了，仪式结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我知道你们有诸多疑问。请听——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群安静下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窸窸窣窣的响动并未停止，一如往日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>发现了吗？即使回声石碎成渣滓，声音依旧存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>也就是说，外在的形式并不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>真正让它们成立的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师退出角落，任由光照在散落的石块上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浅金色的辉光自裂隙间涌出，彼此缠绕、交织，随即又迅速消散无踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>是这栋建筑本身，甚至更深的……“能量”，或是“秩序”流淌的规律。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>止于此，止于我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她无法聆听更多——但很近了，她正在一步一步接近它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>我从来不知道，原来建筑师是这样的“疯子”。现在我相信即使世界末日也无法阻挡你想要重建的决心了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师摇摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>没有什么在阻挡我，一切都是自然而然的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>废墟重组，时代向前，人们继续生活——这是自然规律。而我做的，只是站在它出现的地方，试图理解它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>自然规律……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣不赞同地皱起鼻子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师并未听到同伴那微不可闻的质疑。她继续从容地梳理并总结自己的观点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>总而言之……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>基金会没有急着把我们召回去，恐怕还在研讨接下来该把我们往哪一个工地里塞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哪怕只剩下一天、一个小时，我也有继续画图的自由。不是吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-14"}}